{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1000_p", "source_sha256": "380c2047a4d7c98b416830d619a89fa937b48ba4daab09023f0944116386a9a0", "ja": "あれ、ひなた、また衣装の試着をしているのか。", "zh": "咦，日向，你又在试穿服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "f79ab1ed77404f59d3e41293a69d326b76627d3ac63d5008fddda67c5836d393", "ja": "{$P$}！　えへへ、嬉しくってねえ、\n何度でも着たくなるんだぁ……。", "zh": "{$P$}！嘿嘿，因为我很高兴啊，\n才会想一穿再穿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e392ac11264c6c227d27a0d8d25373818af7e117f8e76614be983c703c59c37b", "ja": "ブログも読ませてもらったけど、その衣装、\n本当にひなたによく似合ってて、カワイイよな。", "zh": "我看过你的部落格了，\n那套服装真的很适合日向，很可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "1f15086c21a23b8ac29767028074b294d6bd66dcf6b1c7c53fb70ae8f7b5834d", "ja": "わ、わあ……なんだか恥ずかしいねぇ……！", "zh": "哇、哇啊……总觉得好害羞呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "eaafec781856f62be80df3275601015aadbc4d761b53db1233396bd1c8f912c0", "ja": "そりゃあ、こったらめんこい衣装なんだもの、\n誰でもカワイくみせてくれるっしょや。", "zh": "毕竟是这么可爱的服装，\n无论谁穿起来都会很可爱哪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "b173c5b1496668ff471efa5be68da60f60e761a61d7ac0864d5c4f55a8293ceb", "ja": "本当はずっと着ていたいけど、汚したら衣装屋さんに\n申し訳ないからねぇ、すぐに脱がねば……。", "zh": "其实我是很想一直穿着的，但要是弄脏\n就对不起租衣店了，得赶快脱下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ea279b327980eb1c72e1f6c5e00348cdaf0d9047673b1b58e00d51c941c75ae7", "ja": "……うん？　それはひなたの衣装だぞ？", "zh": "……嗯？那是日向的服装喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "ca1ad5e49ea53a75ebb3087637f3e27ef17bd16713044bd5480c929908f1c436", "ja": "うん、知ってるよぉ。\nあたしのために用意してくれた貸衣装なんでしょや？", "zh": "嗯，我知道。\n这套是你特别为我借来的服装对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d5d94a22ec54b1025c2d303bd9ad63583b25251d489a227ad2b41a4eb87a9e60", "ja": "ああ……どうも話がかみ合わないと思った。\n言ってなかったっけ、それは貸衣装じゃないよ。", "zh": "啊……难怪我觉得有点鸡同鸭讲。\n我之前没说过吗？那套服装不是借来的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d9ad71cdb71989a3f27650ce2208dea232ac6eef94b8d0f1abd99db676c47112", "ja": "ひなたのためのオーダーメイドの衣装なんだ。\nひなた専用だから、ずっと着ててもいいんだぞ。", "zh": "那是为日向特别订做的服装。\n因为是专属于日向的，你想一直穿着也可以喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "293faa1e074c6110e09ba3458cc0c25f4cfaaccdbcda498328889384c5e3888c", "ja": "え……？　え……ぇ……えぇっ！？\n専用って、つまり、あたし用ってことなのかい！？", "zh": "咦……？咦……咦……咦咦！？\n你说专属，意思是，专门给我穿的是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "ebb70571c8e6f617eec4ff9e27d1c2e63c5f3954c2fc63b00e9d0056ef235310", "ja": "ど、どうしたらいいんだべか？　こったらすごいもん\n作ってもらって、あたし、お返しできないよぉ……！", "zh": "该、该怎么办？让你为我订做了这么棒的东西，\n我怎么回报哪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1012_p", "source_sha256": "40f9ea17ef3e74d445b1b652ce7e35aed6f6aac0cc9f94942b23fb43dd91214f", "ja": "ははは。お返しなんていらないけど、その衣装で\nひなたがステージで活躍してくれたら、一番嬉しいよ。", "zh": "哈哈哈，不需要什么回报啦。只要日向能穿着\n这套服装活跃在舞台上，对我来说就再开心不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "f706e7fb341643a311fc28691fcc2665adb25aaae51d199749153342c53da541", "ja": "う、うぅ……あたしが……活躍……。\n何すればいいか、まだわかんないけど……。", "zh": "呜、呜呜……活跃……在舞台上……\n虽然还不知道该怎么做才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "d790a135c6801d0497dd062cbded63a77db1dccdd66e99b3b550737ab251bc08", "ja": "でも、そうだねぇ。嬉しいって気持ちは、\nきっといっぱい舞台で出せるって思うよぉ。", "zh": "不过，也是哪。这份开心的心情，\n我想一定能在舞台上满满表现出来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "054b5ad9272693ee65d03cd2a3e716beb4ec58f81b6932e60ac3bb51637d901c", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとねぇ。\nあたし、精一杯頑張るから、見ていてください。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你哪。\n我会努力加油的，请你要看着我喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0034_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9a43fbf62666f950e35a20bb95b7e518dac678a5d51bb72e16184813ecd0ac39", "ja": "（ひなたに静かな闘志が、芽生え始めているのかも\nしれない。これは、次のライブが楽しみだぞ！）", "zh": "（看来日向似乎默默地燃起了斗志。\n下次的演唱会肯定很值得期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
